<title>USA: AMR Corp Q1 net drops.</title>
<headline>AMR Corp Q1 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.65		    $2.02</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.65		     1.84</p>
<p> Net			152,000		  157,000</p>
<p> Total oper revs    4,426,000		4,308,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	92,000		   78,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	92,000		   92,000</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: AMR said it recorded a $20 million pre-tax charge in 1997 Q1 which, together with previously accrued amounts, reflected 5.75 million stock options being offered to its pilots at $10 a share below market value. The options were offered as part of a wage settlement that has not yet been ratified by union members.</p>
</text>
